{"channelId":"UCgQcchNiVjJj7JyJe7LOCkA","row":["Holistic Touch Therapy",98,"Holistic Touch Therapy offers massage and acupressure classes for competitive, working, recreational, and infirm canine athletes. These modalities can stimulate the canine competitor, energize the working dog, invigorate the couch potato and improve fitness in all dogs. Massage and acupressure can also comfort and encourage healing in a sick or injured dog, relax the stressed or anxious dog, and build confidence in the shy, abused, neglected or rescued dog by promoting homeostatic balance in the body's organ systems.","",""],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCgQcchNiVjJj7JyJe7LOCkA","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCgQcchNiVjJj7JyJe7LOCkA","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:11:06.984Z","channelId":"UCgQcchNiVjJj7JyJe7LOCkA","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"f73ff65bb73ce78c3e8fe59a7da5631a64751fd0146eef7ff599f9afbfbff672","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"834aa3db44b1ba56d61a545ea355640859ab3bc160719a4ed2f0a73fbfb5529c"},"countrySource":{},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCgQcchNiVjJj7JyJe7LOCkA","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":98,"raw":"98 subscribers","precision":"exact","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCgQcchNiVjJj7JyJe7LOCkA","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:11:06.984Z"}],"emails":[],"contactPages":[],"matchedKeywords":[],"relevantKeywords":[],"priorityKeywords":[],"quality":[{"keyword":"massage therapist","relevant":false,"evidenceLevel":"unconfirmed","role":"undetermined","flags":["当前仅有相关内容或名称线索，尚无匹配的本人专业简介；不列入职业联系优选"],"sourceUrls":[]}],"cleanup":{"status":"review","code":"biography_audience_review","reason":"简介上下文未证明本人与目标人群的关系；保留原记录，不猜测身份。","keywords":[],"role":"undetermined","excerpt":"and build confidence in the shy, abused, neglected or rescued dog by promoting homeostatic balance in the body's organ systems.","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/